│ used by default.                                                                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ 2. Supply some out-of-box APIs within interacting with Mem0. It will support extended metadata injection during `add`/`update` operations,      │
│ which can help LLM decision-making (ref: https://docs.mem0.ai/core-concepts/memory-operations/update#use-cases).                                │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ ```python                                                                                                                                       │
│ class Mem0:                                                                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│     def add(self, content: object | str, metadata: dict):                                                                                       │
